{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-60805","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-92052","text":"Collapsing the docs atlas onto one canonical host"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60807","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-92053","text":"## ⚠ NOT ADOPTED — decided against 2026-08-13, the same day this was written.  This document was written to execute "},{"id":"spn-92054","marks":["code"],"text":"ACADEMY.md"},{"id":"spn-92055","text":" step A1b as that step was worded. Measuring the premise afterwards showed the step was asserting a "},{"id":"spn-92056","marks":["bold"],"text":"mechanism"},{"id":"spn-92057","text":" (301s exist) rather than the "},{"id":"spn-92058","marks":["bold"],"text":"outcome"},{"id":"spn-92059","text":" it wanted (one host accumulates the citations) — and the outcome already holds without any redirect:  - every page on all twelve non-canonical hosts declares "},{"id":"spn-92060","marks":["code"],"text":"canonical → docs.ampersandboxdesign.com"},{"id":"spn-92061","text":" - the sitemap they serve lists "},{"id":"spn-92062","marks":["bold"],"text":"only"},{"id":"spn-92063","text":" canonical-host URLs — they do not advertise themselves - their "},{"id":"spn-92064","marks":["code"],"text":"robots.txt"},{"id":"spn-92065","text":" points its "},{"id":"spn-92066","marks":["code"],"text":"Sitemap:"},{"id":"spn-92067","text":" line at the canonical host - "},{"id":"spn-92068","marks":["bold"],"text":"nothing links to them."},{"id":"spn-92069","text":" The shared nav links the canonical host 34×; across every marketing   site it is the only docs link  Unlinked, unsitemapped and self-declaring as copies, the twelve are effectively undiscoverable, and an engine that does reach one consolidates it. Buying that with twelve permanent edge rules — whose failure mode is a loop that takes the atlas down on all thirteen hostnames at once — is a bad trade.  "},{"id":"spn-92070","marks":["bold"],"text":"Everything below is retained deliberately, not by neglect."},{"id":"spn-92071","text":" If the decision is revisited, the configuration is here and the reasoning does not have to be re-derived. "},{"id":"spn-92072","marks":["code"],"text":"verify-canonical.sh"},{"id":"spn-92073","text":" still works and still exits 1, which is now the "},{"id":"spn-92074","marks":["italic"],"text":"expected"},{"id":"spn-92075","text":" result rather than a pending task.  The live question A1b leaves behind is not a redirect: "},{"id":"spn-92076","marks":["bold"],"text":"why are twelve unused custom domains attached to the Pages project?"},{"id":"spn-92077","text":" Detaching them dissolves the question entirely."}]}],"id":"blk-60806","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-60808","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-92078","marks":["bold"],"text":"Status:"},{"id":"spn-92079","text":" written 2026-08-13, "},{"id":"spn-92080","marks":["bold"],"text":"not applied and not planned"},{"id":"spn-92081","text":". "},{"id":"spn-92082","marks":["bold"],"text":"Supersedes:"},{"id":"spn-92083","text":" nothing. "},{"id":"spn-92084","marks":["bold"],"text":"Superseded by:"},{"id":"spn-92085","text":" the measurement above."}]},{"id":"blk-60809","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-92086","text":"The "},{"id":"spn-92087","marks":["code"],"text":"docs"},{"id":"spn-92088","text":" Cloudflare Pages project has thirteen custom domains attached. All thirteen serve byte-identical content at HTTP 200, so 434 documents are published at roughly 5,600 URLs. Every page already declares "},{"id":"spn-92089","marks":["code"],"text":"<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://docs.ampersandboxdesign.com/…\">"},{"id":"spn-92090","text":"; what is missing is enforcement."}]},{"id":"blk-60810","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-92091","text":"This cannot be done from the repository. Cloudflare Pages' "},{"id":"spn-92092","marks":["code"],"text":"_redirects"},{"id":"spn-92093","text":" matches paths, not hostnames, and all thirteen domains are served by one deployment — so a "},{"id":"spn-92094","marks":["code"],"text":"_redirects"},{"id":"spn-92095","text":" entry would fire on the canonical host too. It has to be done at the edge."}]},{"id":"blk-60811","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-92096","text":"Option A — one Bulk Redirect list (recommended)"}]},{"id":"blk-60812","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-92097","text":"Account-level, so twelve hostnames are configured in one place rather than twelve."}]},{"id":"blk-60813","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-92098","marks":["bold"],"text":"Dashboard →"},{"id":"spn-92099","text":" Account Home → Bulk Redirects → Create a redirect list → name it "},{"id":"spn-92100","marks":["code"],"text":"docs-canonical"},{"id":"spn-92101","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-60814","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-92102","text":"For each row below: "},{"id":"spn-92103","marks":["bold"],"text":"Status `301`"},{"id":"spn-92104","text":", and enable "},{"id":"spn-92105","marks":["bold"],"text":"Preserve query string"},{"id":"spn-92106","text":", "},{"id":"spn-92107","marks":["bold"],"text":"Subpath matching"},{"id":"spn-92108","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-92109","marks":["bold"],"text":"Preserve path suffix"},{"id":"spn-92110","text":". Leave "},{"id":"spn-92111","marks":["italic"],"text":"Include subdomains"},{"id":"spn-92112","text":" off."}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-60816","spans":[{"id":"spn-92113","text":"Source URL"}]},{"id":"blk-60817","spans":[{"id":"spn-92114","text":"Target URL"}]}],"id":"blk-60815","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-60818","spans":[{"id":"spn-92115","marks":["code"],"text":"docs.agentelic.com/"}]},{"id":"blk-60819","spans":[{"id":"spn-92116","marks":["code"],"text":"https://docs.ampersandboxdesign.com/"}]}],[{"id":"blk-60820","spans":[{"id":"spn-92117","marks":["code"],"text":"docs.agentromatic.com/"}]},{"id":"blk-60821","spans":[{"id":"spn-92118","marks":["code"],"text":"https://docs.ampersandboxdesign.com/"}]}],[{"id":"blk-60822","spans":[{"id":"spn-92119","marks":["code"],"text":"docs.bendscript.com/"}]},{"id":"blk-60823","spans":[{"id":"spn-92120","marks":["code"],"text":"https://docs.ampersandboxdesign.com/"}]}],[{"id":"blk-60824","spans":[{"id":"spn-92121","marks":["code"],"text":"docs.delegatic.com/"}]},{"id":"blk-60825","spans":[{"id":"spn-92122","marks":["code"],"text":"https://docs.ampersandboxdesign.com/"}]}],[{"id":"blk-60826","spans":[{"id":"spn-92123","marks":["code"],"text":"docs.deliberatic.com/"}]},{"id":"blk-60827","spans":[{"id":"spn-92124","marks":["code"],"text":"https://docs.ampersandboxdesign.com/"}]}],[{"id":"blk-60828","spans":[{"id":"spn-92125","marks":["code"],"text":"docs.fleetprompt.com/"}]},{"id":"blk-60829","spans":[{"id":"spn-92126","marks":["code"],"text":"https://docs.ampersandboxdesign.com/"}]}],[{"id":"blk-60830","spans":[{"id":"spn-92127","marks":["code"],"text":"docs.geofleetic.com/"}]},{"id":"blk-60831","spans":[{"id":"spn-92128","marks":["code"],"text":"https://docs.ampersandboxdesign.com/"}]}],[{"id":"blk-60832","spans":[{"id":"spn-92129","marks":["code"],"text":"docs.graphonomous.com/"}]},{"id":"blk-60833","spans":[{"id":"spn-92130","marks":["code"],"text":"https://docs.ampersandboxdesign.com/"}]}],[{"id":"blk-60834","spans":[{"id":"spn-92131","marks":["code"],"text":"docs.opensentience.org/"}]},{"id":"blk-60835","spans":[{"id":"spn-92132","marks":["code"],"text":"https://docs.ampersandboxdesign.com/"}]}],[{"id":"blk-60836","spans":[{"id":"spn-92133","marks":["code"],"text":"docs.specprompt.com/"}]},{"id":"blk-60837","spans":[{"id":"spn-92134","marks":["code"],"text":"https://docs.ampersandboxdesign.com/"}]}],[{"id":"blk-60838","spans":[{"id":"spn-92135","marks":["code"],"text":"docs.ticktickclock.com/"}]},{"id":"blk-60839","spans":[{"id":"spn-92136","marks":["code"],"text":"https://docs.ampersandboxdesign.com/"}]}],[{"id":"blk-60840","spans":[{"id":"spn-92137","marks":["code"],"text":"docs.webhost.systems/"}]},{"id":"blk-60841","spans":[{"id":"spn-92138","marks":["code"],"text":"https://docs.ampersandboxdesign.com/"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-60842","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-92139","text":"Then Bulk Redirects → Create rule → attach the "},{"id":"spn-92140","marks":["code"],"text":"docs-canonical"},{"id":"spn-92141","text":" list → Deploy."}]},{"id":"blk-60843","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-92142","marks":["bold"],"text":"`docs.ampersandboxdesign.com` must NOT appear in that list."},{"id":"spn-92143","text":" Adding it produces a redirect loop that takes the atlas down on every host at once."}]},{"id":"blk-60844","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-92144","text":"Option B — twelve Redirect Rules, one per zone"}]},{"id":"blk-60845","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-92145","text":"Use this if Bulk Redirects is unavailable. In each of the twelve zones: "},{"id":"spn-92146","marks":["bold"],"text":"Rules → Redirect Rules → Create rule"},{"id":"spn-92147","text":", named "},{"id":"spn-92148","marks":["code"],"text":"docs → canonical"},{"id":"spn-92149","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-60846","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60848","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-92150","marks":["bold"],"text":"When incoming requests match"},{"id":"spn-92151","text":" — Custom filter expression:"}]}],"id":"blk-60847","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-60849","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-92152","text":"``"},{"id":"spn-92153","marks":["code"],"text":" (http.host eq \"docs.<ZONE>\") "},{"id":"spn-92154","text":"``"}]},{"id":"blk-60850","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60852","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-92155","marks":["bold"],"text":"Then"},{"id":"spn-92156","text":" — Type "},{"id":"spn-92157","marks":["bold"],"text":"Dynamic"},{"id":"spn-92158","text":", Expression:"}]}],"id":"blk-60851","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-60853","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-92159","text":"``"},{"id":"spn-92160","marks":["code"],"text":" concat(\"https://docs.ampersandboxdesign.com\", http.request.uri.path) "},{"id":"spn-92161","text":"``"}]},{"id":"blk-60854","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60856","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-92162","marks":["bold"],"text":"Status code"},{"id":"spn-92163","text":" "},{"id":"spn-92164","marks":["code"],"text":"301"},{"id":"spn-92165","text":", "},{"id":"spn-92166","marks":["bold"],"text":"Preserve query string"},{"id":"spn-92167","text":" on."}]}],"id":"blk-60855","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-60857","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-92168","text":"Substitute "},{"id":"spn-92169","marks":["code"],"text":"<ZONE>"},{"id":"spn-92170","text":" per zone: "},{"id":"spn-92171","marks":["code"],"text":"agentelic.com"},{"id":"spn-92172","text":", "},{"id":"spn-92173","marks":["code"],"text":"agentromatic.com"},{"id":"spn-92174","text":", "},{"id":"spn-92175","marks":["code"],"text":"bendscript.com"},{"id":"spn-92176","text":", "},{"id":"spn-92177","marks":["code"],"text":"delegatic.com"},{"id":"spn-92178","text":", "},{"id":"spn-92179","marks":["code"],"text":"deliberatic.com"},{"id":"spn-92180","text":", "},{"id":"spn-92181","marks":["code"],"text":"fleetprompt.com"},{"id":"spn-92182","text":", "},{"id":"spn-92183","marks":["code"],"text":"geofleetic.com"},{"id":"spn-92184","text":", "},{"id":"spn-92185","marks":["code"],"text":"graphonomous.com"},{"id":"spn-92186","text":", "},{"id":"spn-92187","marks":["code"],"text":"opensentience.org"},{"id":"spn-92188","text":", "},{"id":"spn-92189","marks":["code"],"text":"specprompt.com"},{"id":"spn-92190","text":", "},{"id":"spn-92191","marks":["code"],"text":"ticktickclock.com"},{"id":"spn-92192","text":", "},{"id":"spn-92193","marks":["code"],"text":"webhost.systems"},{"id":"spn-92194","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-60858","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-92195","text":"Verify"}]},{"id":"blk-60859","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-92196","text":"Run this after applying. It asserts that all twelve redirect and that the canonical host does "},{"id":"spn-92197","marks":["bold"],"text":"not"},{"id":"spn-92198","text":" — a loop is the one failure mode that matters here, and it is the one a spot-check of a single host will miss."}]},{"id":"blk-60860","kind":"code","language":"bash","text":"bash verify-canonical.sh          # from this repo\n# bash docs/verify-canonical.sh   # from the ProjectAmp2 working tree"},{"id":"blk-60861","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-92199","text":"Why 301 and not just the canonical tag"}]},{"id":"blk-60862","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-92200","text":"The canonical tag is a hint an engine may weigh; a 301 is a directive it must follow. Alkeyword's own G10 vocabulary rates this duplicate group as "},{"id":"spn-92201","marks":["bold"],"text":"agree"},{"id":"spn-92202","text":" — every URL naming the same original — which is the mildest form of the problem and the reason this sat unnoticed. It is still twelve copies of the corpus competing for the same citations, and Academy's Layer 1 thesis is that grounded, canonical, extractable pages get cited. Publishing that corpus thirteen times is the opposite of the argument the corpus is making."}]}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaieraxznqmb7eh2hpym5zrzsuqse6cxttk7shgti4elm6zrqzbsdkcn4a","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}